# Excludes third-party dependency source from CodeQL analysis.
# .github/codeql/codeql-config.yml's paths-ignore didn't reliably filter
# Java/Kotlin results under build-mode: manual (11 findings inside
# Capacitor plugins' bundled Java source stayed open after a successful
# run with that config alone) -- .codeqlignore is CodeQL's more robust,
# universally-honored exclusion mechanism, kept alongside the config
# file rather than replacing it.
**/node_modules/**
**/target/**
**/dist/**
